      "supporting_excerpt": "When it comes to the next stage of processing – spherical purified graphite and coated spherical purified graphite, which are essential for lithium-ion battery anodes – the story is entirely different.","relevance_explanation": "Distinguishes processed graphite from raw flake tariffs.","company_applicability": "national_or_sector_context","temporal_status": "proposal_or_uncertain"
